# Chat History And Source-Ledger Area

Status: supporting provenance / consolidation area

This directory may store chat transcripts, source ledgers and message-level consolidation records used to verify where project or reusable planning meaning came from.

## Authority Boundary

Files here are **supporting provenance**, not canonical game-design owners.

```text
chat/source history
  → records what was said, proposed, accepted, questioned or deferred;

project/reusable owner
  → owns the current meaning after review and consolidation.
```

A statement appearing in chat history does not automatically become:

```text
a project decision;
a reusable principle;
a Gameplay Situation / Loop / Dynamic / Scenario;
an implementation decision.
```

Preserve source status where useful:

```text
verbatim;
reconstructed / summarized;
user statement;
assistant proposal;
user acceptance / refinement;
research finding;
deferred / unresolved.
```

## Message References

For long-running work, a branch ledger may assign stable local references such as:

```text
SB-B01-U049
SB-B01-A049
```

or another project-specific scheme.

Use the references to answer:

```text
Was this source contribution reviewed?
Where was it consolidated?
Was it accepted, kept as an idea, turned into a question,
deferred, rejected or found to add no new meaning?
```

Do not require a Planning Item for every message. Record only enough routing/provenance to make future completeness checks possible.
